{"2435870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Rush", "steam_appid": 2435870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.poster.avif?t=1784904625\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.webm?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.mp4?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.poster.avif?t=1784904625\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.webm?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.mp4?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game’s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall… but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD RUSH</strong> is an intense roguelite FPS inspired by genre titans such as <i>ULTRAKILL</i> and <i>Hades</i>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.poster.avif?t=1784904625\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.webm?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/c4581c715997d21b753fc36cc0d3083a.mp4?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a procedurally generated Hell, seize unique weapons, unlock new abilities, and create powerful synergies to overcome the challenges standing between you and freedom. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Speed and Precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hell is unforgiving, your movement skills will be your greatest asset against the relentless hordes of enemies. Whether you choose to dodge attacks from a safe distance or adopt a more aggressive approach, a well-placed headshot will always make the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idols and Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths of Hell and harness the power of <strong>Relics</strong> and <strong>Idols</strong>, granting you powerful upgrades and unique abilities. Adapt your playstyle on the go based on the synergies you discover and the opportunities you seize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.poster.avif?t=1784904625\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.webm?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/extras/24b67e54d6b6fe76b474bb8219a753a5.mp4?t=1784904625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a state of <i>flow</i> during combat to restore your health and gain various bonuses. This state is achieved by actively engaging with the game’s combat mechanics and playing dynamically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Die... and Try Again</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will inevitably fall… but this is not the end, <strong>you are already dead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Persevere, learn from each failure, and push ever forward in your quest for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "BLOOD RUSH is a fast paced, skill based FPS, mixed with roguelites elements. Upgrade yourself, buy unique guns, drain miracles from relics and destroy anyone or anything standing on your way!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Russian, Italian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/83d45268d984ee06fc22fce2a2b863242187f516/header.jpg?t=1784904625", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/858e21f778e203d59dbee76206df146a2a29ad0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784904625", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435870/858e21f778e203d59dbee76206df146a2a29ad0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784904625", "website": "https://www.maxestla.com/blood-rush/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 980<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["MaxEstLa"], "publishers": ["MaxEstLa"], "demos": [{"appid": 2828980, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 1449, "final": 1449, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$14.49"}, 